<h2>Your Next Move</h2>

<p>You now know more than 90% of people starting hydroponics.</p>

<p><strong>Do this now.</strong> Order the parts above. While they ship, buy a pack of lettuce seeds and a bag of potting soil. Grow 2 to 3 lettuce plants in pots under a cheap LED light. By the time your hydro parts arrive, you'll have seedlings ready to transplant.</p>

<p><strong>That's the secret nobody tells you.</strong> Start in soil, move to hydro. It reduces transplant shock by 90%.</p>

